WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,820
It would be nice to write to your father

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,460
Then I will bear this sin

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,460
Wait until my father receives my letter

4
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,100
Naturally, I will write a letter to the emperor

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,460
Then the Emperor will know that I have been wronged

6
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,180
I will feel ashamed of my father

7
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,620
Wait until my father comes back

8
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,100
Will definitely be reused

9
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,860
This guy is young

10
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:20,210
Is that how you can calculate?

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,020
When did I say I was Prince Su?

12
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,560
Can you speak in front of the emperor?

13
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,960
There are guards around

14
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,320
And around his waist is a gold bag that only the royal family can use.

15
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:30,960
Why not Prince Su?

16
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:35,050
That's all right

17
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,780
There are many dramas about the imperial family in the capital

18
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:39,980
Can make the emperor change his mind

19
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,370
Only Prince Su is smart

20
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,660
But you were only half right

21
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,620
I am a royal prince and don’t talk about the drama

22
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:51,420
But it’s not Prince Su. I don’t believe you continue to make it up.

23
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:54,650
Prince Su is already fifty-six

24
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:57,010
At my age, you think it tastes good

25
00:00:57,370 --> 00:00:59,290
Maybe Prince Su wrote about being young

26
00:00:59,570 --> 00:01:01,690
The other party looks about forty years old.

27
00:01:02,050 --> 00:01:03,090
Not a few gray hairs

28
00:01:03,290 --> 00:01:05,350
Obviously he can't be an old man in his fifties
